OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA murky      
OL,6,Fevening ahead for most with low cloud  
OL,7,Fand patchy drizzle, which lifts slowly 
OL,8,Fovernight leaving the odd clear spell  
OL,9,Flater. It will feel slightly chillier  
OL,10,Fthan Monday night with a light breeze. 
OL,12,CWednesday:FMorning cloud tends to      
OL,13,Fclear, with plenty of sunshine by      
OL,14,FWednesday afternoon, but a chillier    
OL,15,Fday than Tuesday with light winds.     
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
