OL,3,GWest Midlands                          
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:      
OL,6,FFrosty and cloudy on Thursday, before  
OL,7,Fturning wet and windy into Friday.     
OL,8,FDrier by Friday afternoon, but very    
OL,9,Fmurky into Saturday with fog and       
OL,10,Fpatchy drizzle. Chilly overnight with  
OL,11,Ffrost.                                 
